Copyright (c) NXAI GmbH and its affiliates 2023, 2024
Authors include Maximilian Beck and Korbinian Pöppel.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The original Python implementation has been modified and reimplemented in Rust
using Burn tensor operations, configuration, modules, and automatic differentiation.
The port adds explicit streaming state, safe numerical edge-case handling, and
independent validation fixtures generated by executing the upstream implementation.

